    "답하지 않고 닫아도 괜찮아요. 확인되지 않은 밤은 그을음 없이 넘어가요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's fine to close this without answering. Unconfirmed nights pass without any scorch."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "답하지 않고 닫아도 괜찮아요. 확인되지 않은 밤은 그을음 없이 넘어가요."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "答えずに閉じても大丈夫です。確認できなかった夜は焦げ跡なしで過ぎていきます。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's fine to close this without answering. Unconfirmed nights pass without any scorch."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes cerrar sin responder. Las noches sin confirmar pasan sin chamusquina."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst schließen, ohne zu antworten. Nicht bestätigte Nächte vergehen ohne Brandfleck."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不回答直接关闭也没关系。没有确认的夜晚不会留下焦痕。"
