    "불을 끄지 못했어도, 제시간에 잠들었으니 불은 저절로 꺼졌어요." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You didn't blow it out, but you fell asleep on time, so the fire went out on its own."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "불을 끄지 못했어도, 제시간에 잠들었으니 불은 저절로 꺼졌어요."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "火は消せませんでしたが、時間どおりに眠ったので、火は自然に消えました。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You didn't blow it out, but you fell asleep on time, so the fire went out on its own."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No soplaste, pero te dormiste a tu hora y el fuego se apagó solo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast nicht gepustet, aber du bist pünktlich eingeschlafen, also ist das Feuer von selbst ausgegangen."
